# Drover Grizzly: the trigger needs "attacks while saddled" (CR 702.171b): an unsaddled attack gives nothing, neither to the Grizzly nor to Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Drover Grizzly
Memnite
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Drover Grizzly.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Drover Grizzly > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Drover Grizzly.Keywords = (absent)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
